# text
seg-fd60dded7bc0 = The whole validated engine and every surface, free with no feature gate. Everything on this site runs on it.

# text
seg-12f050093898 = Why everyone needs it

# text
seg-5d04ff55adbb = Anyone who takes position or time from GNSS (Global Navigation Satellite Systems) is exposed: jamming, spoofing and signal loss reach vehicles, networks, grids and spacecraft alike. The open core shows how exposed, and says which figures are checked.

# text
seg-abc6bb005249 = Engineers of vehicles, networks, grids and spacecraft that take position or time from GNSS

# text
seg-21989d609ae7 = Researchers, students and reviewers who need figures they can reproduce and cite

# text
seg-3b6d727a2d38 = Developers wiring the engine into code, a CI (continuous integration) suite or an AI (artificial intelligence) assistant

# text
seg-7515b1af1f0b = All { "93" } scenario kinds and { "183" } bundled scenarios: native, Python, JavaScript, in the browser and over MCP (Model Context Protocol)

# text
seg-358de5b2bfb3 = The full verification matrix: { "176" } of { "413" } capabilities validated against independent oracles, the rest labelled Modelled

# text
seg-9b8eb955fecf = Every result stamped with scenario hash, seed and engine version, and written as JSON (JavaScript Object Notation), CSV (comma-separated values) tables and SVG (Scalable Vector Graphics) charts

